{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13105020","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13105020","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1310502001:0":{"text":"그곳은 첫 번째 신과 악마의 전쟁이 벌어진 곳이었어요. 많은 용사가 묻혔고요.","source_cn":"那里曾是恶魔战争的一处战场，有许多勇士埋骨泥下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E904D6975032812","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1310502002:0":{"text":"전쟁이 끝난 후, 갑자기 그곳에 꽃이 피어났고 겨울이 되어도 시들지 않았지요.","source_cn":"战争结束后，那里突然长满了鲜花，即便冬季也从不衰败。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47752C90950E891B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1310502003:0":{"text":"어쩌면 그 꽃들에 정말로 영웅들의 영혼이 깃들어 있을지도 모르겠네요...","source_cn":"或许真有英雄的灵魂寄托在那些花中吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9EEA9231301716C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:法拉莫尔":{"text":"팔라모르","source":"法拉莫尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}}